# THE BIG CHECK. The verdict comes from pure Lean (PEqualNP/Verify/Axioms.lean, `#verify_axioms`): every theorem of
# every module of the one-NOT project rests on propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound only, except the 21 names on
# the allow-list (the open statement no_minCE with what is derived from it, and a parked draft), which may use sorryAx.
# asteroid only starts the build and reads its summary line. Without asteroid:  cd one-not/lean && lake build PEqualNP.Verify.All
verify lean one-not/lean

